n II  is simply connected. It's a plane region without holes.\n\n- Region III is *not* simply connected.  The region contains all the points of ${R}^{2}$ except those on the coordinate axes.  Thus, the region is formed by four disjoint pieces and, therefore, is not even a connected region.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372505 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372506 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372507 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372508 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372509 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1041 "selection" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1104 #edb/ref 17592186372509 13194139535884 true] [17592186372504 1110 #uuid "14625eb8-2ebb-5541-994b-75d185efcd00" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372505 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372505 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535884 true] [17592186372505 1111 #uuid "34712083-f573-5d66-8400-15adfd5befa5" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372506 1034 "I only" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372506 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535884 true] [17592186372506 1111 #uuid "ae274752-b385-5bea-8052-2bfa0e7b8047" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372507 1034 "III only" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372507 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535884 true] [17592186372507 1111 #uuid "e6cc128c-9875-5605-9acb-c14862a821cc" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372508 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535884 true] [17592186372508 1111 #uuid "55a0c334-0cc4-5f84-be32-e3cbcc1fb936" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372509 1034 "II only" 13194139535884 true] [17592186372509 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535884 true] [17592186372509 1111 #uuid "c8f548bd-b0ec-5da4-85c9-40ecc7fd4f6f" 13194139535884 tr